Koeta Studio third-party notices
=================================

This file lists third-party material that is embedded in Koeta Studio
binaries. It is not a complete audit of every Cargo/Python dependency; see
docs/dependency-audit.md and docs/workstreams/final-license-audit.md for that
status. Licence texts of the compiled Rust crates, including the egui default
fonts (Hack, Ubuntu Light, Noto Emoji, emoji-icon-font), are in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt (summary: docs/third-party-license-report.md). The original project source is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE).

